      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done. However `DawnBuffer::onMap()` is expensive for native as well. Right now, `DawnBuffer::onMap()` calls `MapAsync()` followed with `Tick()` call immediately.\n\n* `MapAsync()` is equal to `vkCmdPipelineBarrier()` call with vulkan,\n* `Tick()` is equal to `vkQueueSubmit()` and `vkWaitForFence()`, and then call complete callback of the `MapAsync()`.\n\nThat is why we want to call `MapAsync()` earlier. So all `MapAsync()` call will record the pipeline barriers into the same pending command buffer, that command buffer could be submitted with either one `Tick()` call or when the graphite submits a recorded graphite\u0027s command buffer.",
      "parentUuid": "d8fc767c_d043267b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 174,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 174,
